  "disclaimer_extra": "Just Salad's guide (July 2026) states that its menu items do NOT include dressing in their nutrition or allergens, so a named salad here needs a dressing added the same way a built one does. Portions are standard, without serving weights; base greens/grains are listed per format (salad, warm bowl, market plate, wrap). Dressing values are the 1 oz 'light' serving. Menu rotates seasonally.",
